## 🛡️ Defensive Takeaway
Tools like Veil-Evasion prove that **static signature detection is insufficient** against custom-compiled wrappers. Organizations must enforce **Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR)** with **AMSI (Antimalware Scan Interface)** integration to inspect deobfuscated scripts and API memory calls (`VirtualAlloc`, `CreateRemoteThread`) at runtime.
